<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπό-δεικτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not proved, undemonstrated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1143b12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without proof,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>CG</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of first
			principles, <i>indemonstrable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				415b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				53b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				57b33
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. συλλογισμοί,</span> of
			syllogisms, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.79
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.173
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).160
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>incapable of proof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>furnishing no proof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPar.
				15.3.62
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.90
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
